    "description": "<p>You pull yourself along a cord of incredibly strong metal.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. You can pull yourself towards the target or pull the target towards you if it is your size or smaller.</p><p>If the target is a creature and you choose to pull it towards you, it must succeed on an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or be pulled adjacent to you, where it lands <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>If it succeeds, you are instead pulled adjacent to the target, where you land <strong>Prone</strong>.</p>",
